house: A house is a building where people live. | kind: place, building
school: A school is a place where children learn from teachers. | kind: place, building
hospital: A hospital is a building where sick or hurt people are cared for. | kind: place, building
shop, store: A shop or store is a place where you can buy things. | kind: place, building
park: A park is a public green place with grass and trees where people walk and play. | kind: place, building
farm: A farm is land where people grow crops and keep animals. | kind: place, building
beach: A beach is the sandy or rocky land next to the sea. | kind: place, building
library: A library is a building. | kind: place, building
bank: A bank is a building. | kind: place, building
restaurant: A restaurant is a building. | kind: place, building
zoo: A zoo is a building. | kind: place, building
museum: A museum is a building. | kind: place, building
airport: An airport is a building. | kind: place, building
station: A station is a building. | kind: place, building
